{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫戀綜《女神配對計劃2》參賽者多是非，最近現年36歲、曾任投資銀行高層嘅關經翰（Oswald）先後獲俞可程與梁超怡青睞，最新節目中更與女神陳星妤欽點共進晚餐及「同帳幕過夜」。</p><p>惟尋日（17日）即爆出佢疑似秘撻前亞姐兼有「美人魚小姐」稱號嘅練</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:25:33.244136+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T03:16:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T04:18:46.459605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:18:46.459605+00:00","content_hash":"67232fb17bfa5232afb368267504939aaaea3ad89cdcc319f6c3dd91e6f570b9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}